# FVG exit signal: a trade is closed when, after its first target (or its entry), a 1H FVG prints in its direction and price comes back into it and a 1H
# candle closes beyond it against the trade.   bb (default): only trades on a breaker block   all: every trade   off: never
# FVG_EXIT=bb
